# Files the Vercel CLI should not upload.
#
# Vercel excludes `.next` and `node_modules` by default, but not sibling build
# directories a local verification run might create — and an unignored one gets
# uploaded in full. A stray `.next-build` once made this upload 252 MB.
#
# None of this is needed remotely: Vercel installs dependencies and builds
# from source.

# Local build output
.next
.next-*

# Test and coverage artefacts
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local Supabase stack
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp

# Local env files (Vercel supplies its own)
.env.local
.env.local.*

# Internal planning notes
PLANNA_UI_MASTERPLAN.md
PROGRESS.md
phase*.md
PLANNA_BUILD_SPEC.md
parser_fix.md
task-scheduling-plan.md

# Logs
*.log
